    "title": "Breeze Airways",
    "description": "Make flying a breeze when you search, book, track and manage your flights from the palm of your hand. Check-in with ease and skip the lines with your mobile boarding pass.\r\n\r\nFeatures include: \r\n\u2022\tSearch and book flights on the fly \r\n\u2022\tManage your existing bookings including changes and cancellations without needing to talk to a person \r\n\u2022\tKeep track of your BreezePoints \u00ae and update your account profile \r\n\u2022\tStay up to date on flight status\r\n \r\nWe will be updating our app frequently as we bring Breeze service to more and more destinations in the coming months. Please rate, review and let us know how we can create an even better Breeze experience for you!",
